# 1. Data Extraction

The extraction process retrieves weather forecasts for Moroccan cities.

The city dataset provides:

```text
city
latitude
longitude
```

These coordinates are used to query Open-Meteo.

### Open-Meteo variables

The pipeline retrieves:

```text
weather_code
temperature_2m_max
temperature_2m_min
precipitation_sum
precipitation_probability_max
wind_speed_10m_max
wind_gusts_10m_max
```

The forecast date is also retrieved.

The extraction code is located in:

```text
extraction/extract_weather.py
```

