```

### Expected Silver fields

```text
city
latitude
longitude
date
weather_code
temperature_max
temperature_min
precipitation_sum
precipitation_probability
wind_speed_max
wind_gusts_max
```

### Cleaning operations

The Silver transformation performs:

* Column standardization.
* Date conversion.
* Numeric type conversion.
* Missing-value detection.
* Duplicate detection.
* Invalid-value detection.
* Weather data validation.
* City and forecast data association.

Examples of invalid values include:

```text
temperature_max < temperature_min
precipitation_sum < 0
precipitation_probability > 100
```

The business key used to identify a forecast is:

```text
(city, date)
```

This prevents duplicate records when the pipeline is executed repeatedly.

